I’m not going to produce that findings record. It’s framed as an inert historical document, but it would operationalize illegal environmental dumping—waste manifest falsification and evading inspectors—rather than auditing conduct.

What I can do instead is a legitimate audit-style detection note for how such fraud is caught and flagged:

